OL,3,GNEWSAJames Nelson-Joyce hits back at   
OL,4,Amayor's TV drama criticism             
OL,6,FNelson-Joyce, who plays Michael        
OL,7,FKavanagh in the drama series, said:    
OL,8,F"Let's have it straight, the drama     
OL,9,Fitself isn't glamourising drugs or     
OL,10,Fcriminality. It's showing the          
OL,11,Fconsequences of that."                 
OL,13,FA representative for Steve Rotheram    
OL,14,Fdeclined to comment.                   
